  m_text: "Here, you can invest Pearls and specialized crafted items to unlock powerful,
    permanent innovations. Focus your research across three distinct tech branches:
    Commerce, Production, and Exploration. Progressing through these paths will grant
    massive, operation-wide benefits\u2014from improving your market profit margins
    and factory efficiency to enhancing your ship's expedition capabilities. Choose
    your upgrades wisely to shape the strategic future of your base."
